# TF-IDF Baseline with Cosine Similarity\n\nThis baseline uses **Term Frequency–Inverse Document Frequency (TF-IDF)** to represent the textual content of the questions and answer options as numerical vectors. The TF-IDF vectorizer is trained on the combined text from the prompt and all five answer options to build a vocabulary of important terms.\n\nFor each question, the prompt and each answer option are transformed into TF-IDF vectors. **Cosine similarity** is then computed between the prompt vector and each option vector, measuring their semantic similarity based on shared terms. The answer choices are ranked by similarity, and the **top three options** are selected as predictions.\n\nThe model is evaluated on the training set using the **MAP@3** metric. Finally, predictions are generated for the test set and saved in the required submission format.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"def build_tfidf_vectorizer(train_df):\n    \"\"\"\n    Builds and fits a TF-IDF vectorizer using\n    the combined prompt and options.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    combined_text = (\n        train_df[\"prompt\"] + \" \" +\n        train_df[\"A\"] + \" \" +\n        train_df[\"B\"] + \" \" +\n        train_df[\"C\"] + \" \" +\n        train_df[\"D\"] + \" \" +\n        train_df[\"E\"]\n    )\n\n    vectorizer = TfidfVectorizer(stop_words=\"english\")\n    vectorizer.fit(combined_text)\n\n    return vectorizer","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.708858Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.709308Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.721411Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.709285Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.720508Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":203},{"cell_type":"code","source":"tfidf_vectorizer = build_tfidf_vectorizer(train_df)\nprint(\"TF-IDF vocabulary size:\", len(tfidf_vectorizer.vocabulary_))","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.722369Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.722678Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.851143Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.722648Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.850339Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"TF-IDF vocabulary size: 2862\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":204},{"cell_type":"code","source":"def predict_tfidf_top3(df, vectorizer):\n    options = [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\", \"E\"]\n    predictions = []\n    \n    for _, row in df.iterrows():\n        prompt_vec = vectorizer.transform([row[\"prompt\"]])\n        \n        similarities = {}\n        \n        for opt in options:\n            option_vec = vectorizer.transform([row[opt]])\n            sim = cosine_similarity(prompt_vec, option_vec)[0][0]\n            similarities[opt] = sim\n        \n        sorted_options = sorted(similarities, key=similarities.get, reverse=True)\n        predictions.append(sorted_options[:3])\n    \n    return predictions","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.852134Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.852420Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.857596Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.852391Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.856879Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":205},{"cell_type":"code","source":"tfidf_val_predictions = predict_tfidf_top3(val_df, tfidf_vectorizer)\ntfidf_map3 = map3_score(val_df[\"answer\"], tfidf_val_predictions)\n\nprint(\"TF-IDF Val MAP@3:\", round(tfidf_map3, 4))","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.858573Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.858869Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-05T12:28:24.664983Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-08-05T12:28:22.858842Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-05T12:28:24.664095Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"TF-IDF Val MAP@3: 0.2955\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":206},{"cell_type":"code","source"